{
  "description": "Scope patterns on registry repositories. Repository names are exactly <scope>/<image>, which is what keeps a scope grant inside its scope. A pull-through cache repository (\"cache\": true) is named <prefix>/<namespace>/<repository>, three components for Docker Hub; a scope pattern also matches a cached upstream namespace of the same name, which the owner accepted (2026-10-23).",
  "cases": [
    { "pattern": "ezgh:*:org_k3f9a0x2m7qp:prj_g7h8i9j0k1l2:rep_*/team-a/*", "resource": "ezgh:us-west-1:org_k3f9a0x2m7qp:prj_g7h8i9j0k1l2:rep_7m2k9q4x0a1b/team-a/api", "matches": true },
